{title: 679 - God Be in My Head}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #679 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 679}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]God be in [Em/B]my head,
[Am]And [C/G]in [F]my thinking.
[Dm]god be in my eyes,
[Dm]And in [F/C]my looking.
[G7]God be in [Em]my [G7/D]mouth
[C]And in my speaking.
[C]Oh, God be in [F]my [C/E]hear,
[Dm/F]And in my [B/D#]understanding.
{end_of_verse}
